      "date": "2026-05-05T11:29:58.000Z",
      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹0.25 (vs ₹0.011 loss in FY 2025)",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹0.25 (up from ₹0.011 loss in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹277.6m (down 28% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹12.4m (up ₹12.9m from FY 2025). Profit margin: 4.5% (up from net loss in FY 2025). The move to profitability was driven by lower expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 7% per year whereas the company’s share price has increased by 10% per year.",
